Source: linux-@KREL@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ubuntu-tab project <omarfityan@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 bc,
 bison,
 cpio,
 debhelper-compat (=13),
 flex | flex:native,
 kmod,
 libssl-dev:native,
 rsync,
Standards-Version: 4.6.1
Homepage: https://github.com/TBD/ubuntu-tab
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/TBD/ubuntu-tab-x910-kernel.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/TBD/ubuntu-tab-x910-kernel
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: linux-image-@KREL@
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 initramfs-tools | linux-initramfs-tool,
 kmod,
 linux-base,
Provides: wireguard-modules (= 1.0.0)
Description: Linux @KVER@ for @KVENDOR@ devices
 The linux kernel, modules and corresponding other files for
 @KVENDOR@ devices.

Package: linux-headers-@KREL@
Architecture: arm64
Description: Linux kernel headers for @KVENDOR@ devices
 This package provides kernel header files for the @KVENDOR@ kernel.
 .
 This is useful for people who need to build external modules
